"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S24: Avoid contact with skin"
msgstr "S24: चमड़ी के साथ सम्पर्क से बचव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:177
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S25: Avoid contact with eyes"
msgstr "S25: आंख से सम्पर्क से बचव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:178
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S26: In case of contact with eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water "
"and seek medical advice"
msgstr ""
"S26: यदि आँखों मं चला जाथे  तहां तुरंत ही झौंहा सब्बो पानी से आँखों ल धोव अउ डाक्टरी "
"परामर्स लें"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:179
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S27: Take off immediately all contaminated clothing"
msgstr "S27: सब्बो दूसित कपड़ा ल तुरंत उतार देव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:180
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S28: After contact with skin, wash immediately with plenty of ... ( to be "
"specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr ""
"S28: चमड़ी से सम्पर्क होए मं तुरंत ही एखर से धोव ... ( बनइया से निरधारित करना हे )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:181
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S29: Do not empty into drains"
msgstr "S29: नाली मं खाली नइ करव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:182
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S30: Never add water to this product"
msgstr "S30: एखर उत्पाद मं कभी घलोक पानी नइ डालव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:183
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S33: Take precautionary measures against static discharges"
msgstr "S33: स्थैतिक उत्सर्जन के विरुद्ध पूर्वउपाय करव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:184
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S35: This material and its container must be disposed of in a safe way"
msgstr "S35: ए पदार्थ अउ एखर मर्तबान ल सुरक्छित तरीके से फेंका जाना चाही"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:185
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S36: Wear suitable protective clothing"
msgstr "S36: उचित सुरक्छित कपड़े  पहिनव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:186
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S37: Wear suitable gloves"
msgstr "S37: उचित दास्ताने  पहिनव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:187
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S38: In case of insufficient ventilation wear suitable respiratory equipment"
msgstr "S38: अधूरा हवादार छेत्र मं उचित सांस लेने के उपकरन पहिनव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:188
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S39: Wear eye/face protection"
msgstr "S39: आंख/चेहरे के सुरक्छा उपकरन पहिनव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:189
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S40: To clean the floor and all objects contaminated by this material "
"use ... ( to be specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr ""
"S40: फर्स साफ करे बर अउ ए पदार्थ से असुद्ध होय चीज मन ल धोय बर परयोग करव... "
"( बनइया से निरधारित करे जाय )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:190
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S41: In case of fire and/or explosion do not breathe fumes"
msgstr "S41: आग और/या विस्फोट के हालत मं धुंवा ल नइ सूंघव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:191
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S42: During fumigation/spraying wear suitable respiratory equipment "
"( appropriate wording to be specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr ""
"S42: धुआँ करत समय/स्प्रे करत समय सांस लेय के उचित उपकरन पहनव ( उपयुक्त सब्द बनइया द्वारा "
"निरधारित करे जाय )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:192
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S43: In case of fire use ... ( indicate in the space the precise type of "
"fire-fighting equipment. If water increases the risk add - Never use water )"
msgstr ""
"S43: आग लगने के हालत मं ... ( खाली जगह मं निस्चित किसिम के अग्निसमन यंत्र ल इंगित करव. "
"यदि पानी के परयोग से खतरा बढ़थे तहां जोड़व- पानी के परयोग कभू नइ करव )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:193
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S45: In case of accident or if you feel unwell seek medical advice "
"immediately ( show the label where possible )"
msgstr ""
"S45: दुर्घटना के हालत मं या आप मन अस्वस्थ महसूस करत होहू तहां तुरंत ही डाक्टरी परामर्स लेव "
"( जहाँ संभव हो लेबल देखाव )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:194
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S46: If swallowed, seek medical advice immediately and show this container "
"or label"
msgstr "S46: यदि निगल ले हे, तुरंत डाक्टरी परामर्स लेव अउ एखर कंटेनर या लेबल ल देखाव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:195
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S47: Keep at temperature not exceeding ... °C ( to be specified by the "
"manufacturer )"
msgstr "S47: एखर से कम तापक्रम मं रखव ... °C ( बनइया से निरधारित करे जाय )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:196
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S48: Keep wet with ... ( appropriate material to be specified by the "
"manufacturer )"
msgstr "S48: के साथ गीला कर रखव ... ( बनइया से उपयुक्त पदार्थ ल निरधारित करे जाय )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:197
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S49: Keep only in the original container"
msgstr "S49: सिरिफ असली कंटेनर मं ही रखव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:198
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S50: Do not mix with ... ( to be specified by the manufacturer )"
msgstr "S50: एखर साथ नइ मिलाव ... ( बनइया से निरधारित )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:199
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S51: Use only in well-ventilated areas"
msgstr "S51: सिरिफ अच्छा हवादार छेत्र मं ही परयोग करव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:200
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S52: Not recommended for interior use on large surface areas"
msgstr "S52: अंदर के उपयोग या लंबे सतह के छेत्र मं उपयोग बर अनुसंसित नइ"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:201
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S53: Avoid exposure - obtain special instructions before use"
msgstr "S53: एक्सपोजर से बचव - उपयोग से पहिली विसिस्ट निर्देस ल प्राप्त कर लेव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:202
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S56: Dispose of this material and its container at hazardous or special "
"waste collection point"
msgstr ""
"S56: ए पदार्थ ल अउ एखर मर्तबान ल विसेस खतरा वाले घुरवा मं ठिकाना लगाय जाना चाही"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:203
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "S57: Use appropriate containment to avoid environmental contamination"
msgstr "S57: वातावरनीय प्रदूसन से बचने बर समुचित भंडारन उपयोग करव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:204
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S59: Refer to manufacturer/supplier for information on recovery/recycling"
msgstr "S59: रिकवरी/रिसाइकलिंग बर बनइया/सप्लायर से सम्पर्क करव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:205
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S60: This material and its container must be disposed of as hazardous waste"
msgstr "S60: ए पदार्थ अउ एखर मर्तबान ल खतरनाक घुरवा के रूप मं ठिकाना लगाय जाना चाही"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:206
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S61: Avoid release to the environment. Refer to special instructions/safety "
"data sheet"
msgstr "S61: वातावरन मं एखर रिलीज से बचव. विसिस्ट निर्देस/सुरक्छा डाटा सीट ल रेफर करव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:207
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S62: If swallowed, do not induce vomiting: seek medical advice immediately "
"and show this container or label"
msgstr ""
"S62: यदि निगल ले गे हे, उल्टी नइ करवाव: तुरंत ही डाक्टरी परामर्स लेव अउ एखर कंटेनर या "
"लेबल ल देखाव"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:208
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S63: In case of accident by inhalation: remove casualty to fresh air and "
"keep at rest"
msgstr ""
"S63: सूंघ ले मं होए दुर्घटना मं: दुर्घटनाग्रस्त मनखे ल वहाँ से हटाव अउ स्वच्छ हवा में, आराम मं "
"रखव."

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:209
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"S64: If swallowed, rinse mouth with water ( only if the person is conscious )"
msgstr "S64: यदि निगल ले जाथे  मुंह ल पानी से धोव ( तभी जब मनखे होस मं हो )"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:234
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R1: Explosive when dry"
msgstr "R1: जब सूखा होही तहां विस्फोटक"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:235
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"R2: Risk of explosion by shock, friction, fire or other sources of ignition"
msgstr "R2: धक्का, घर्सन, आग या अग्नि के अउ स्रोत से विस्फोट के खतरा"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:236
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid ""
"R3: Extreme risk of explosion by shock, friction, fire or other sources of "
"ignition"
msgstr "R3: धक्का, घर्सन, आग या अग्नि के अउ स्रोत से विस्फोट के बहुत खतरा"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:237
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R4: Forms very sensitive explosive metallic compounds"
msgstr "R4: बहुत ही संवेदनसील विस्फोटक धातुई अवयव बनाथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:238
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R5: Heating may cause an explosion"
msgstr "R5: गर्म करे से विस्फोट हो सकथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:239
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R6: Explosive with or without contact with air"
msgstr "R6: हवा के साथ या बिना ही सम्पर्क से विस्फोटक"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:240
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R7: May cause fire"
msgstr "R7: आग पैदा कर सकथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:241
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R8: Contact with combustible material may cause fire"
msgstr "R8: दहनकारी पदार्थों के सम्पर्क आग पैदा कर सकथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:242
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R9: Explosive when mixed with combustible material"
msgstr "R9: दहनकारी पदार्थों के साथ मिलाय मं विस्फोटक"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:243
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R10: Flammable"
msgstr "R10: ज्वलनसील"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:244
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R11: Highly flammable"
msgstr "R11: जादा ज्वलनसील"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:245
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R12: Extremely flammable"
msgstr "R12: बहुत ज्वलनसील"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:246
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R14: Reacts violently with water"
msgstr "R14: सिरिफ पानी के साथ प्रतिकिरिया करथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:247
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R15: Contact with water liberates extremely flammable gases"
msgstr "R15: पानी के साथ सम्पर्क मं बहुत ज्वलनसील गैस उत्सर्जित करथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:248
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R16: Explosive when mixed with oxidising substances"
msgstr "R16: आक्सीकारक अवयव मन से मिलाय मं विस्फोटक"

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:249
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R17: Spontaneously flammable in air"
msgstr "R17: हवा मं जल्दी जल सकथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:250
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R18: In use, may form flammable/explosive vapour-air mixture"
msgstr "R18: परयोग मं ए ज्वलनसील/विस्फोटक वास्प-वायु मिस्रन बना सकथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:251
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R19: May form explosive peroxides"
msgstr "R19: विस्फोटक पराक्साइड बना सकथे "

#: src/rsdialog.cpp:252
msgctxt ""
"Please take the official translations! You find them here: http://europa.eu."
"int/eur-lex/lex/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=CELEX:32001L0059:EN:HTML"
msgid "R20: Harmful by inhalation"
msgstr "R20: सांस से खींचे बर मं नुकसानदेह"

